{"id": "86324", "name": "פונקציה מעריכית 9^x – הקלט עבור פלט נתון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>A function \\( f : R \\rightarrow R\\) is defined by the rule \\[ f(x) = {{CT:0}}.\\] Which input of the function \\(f\\), has the output {{CT:1}}? [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>To find the input, we need to find the value of \\(x\\) for which \\[{{CT:0}} = {{CT:2}}.\\] It can easily be checked that this is true for \\(x = {{CT:3}}\\).</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<p>The value of the function for your input is \\({@ev(9^(ans1),simp)@}\\) which is not equal to {{CT:1}}.</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f1", "n1", "output"], "nvariants": 9}